cff-version: 1.2.0
title: ResumeAtlas Research
message: >-
  If you use these datasets or findings, please cite them using the
  metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: ResumeAtlas
    website: "https://resumeatlas.io"
repository-code: "https://github.com/deepsyyt/resumeatlas-research"
url: "https://resumeatlas.io/resume-insights"
abstract: >-
  Aggregate statistics from real resume-to-job-description analyses and
  resume parsing checks run on ResumeAtlas. Covers keyword coverage,
  required-versus-preferred skill gaps, bullet-point quantification,
  application verdicts and machine-readability of resume documents.
  Aggregate only: contains no resume text, no personal data and no
  hiring-outcome data.
keywords:
  - resume
  - curriculum vitae
  - applicant tracking system
  - ATS
  - job matching
  - resume parsing
  - hiring
  - labour market
license: CC-BY-4.0
